### Sample requests (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio).
### Paste the random local development keys printed by `docker compose logs db-init` (see README).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminKey = <paste the sm_devadm01_... key here>
@crewingKey = <paste the sm_devcrw01_... key here>

### Liveness and readiness (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
X-Api-Key: {{crewingKey}}

### My ships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/ships
X-Api-Key: {{crewingKey}}

### Create a user (Administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane.doe@example.com", "role": "Superintendent" }

### List users (Administrator)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&role=CrewingOfficer
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Create a ship (Administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ships
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shipCode": "SHIP06", "shipName": "Nautilus", "fiscalYearCode": "0403" }

### List ships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ships?status=Active
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Deactivate a ship (Administrator)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ships/SHIP06
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Inactive" }

### Assign a ship to user 2 (Administrator, idempotent)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2/ships/SHIP03
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Ships of user 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2/ships
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Crew list: paged, sorted by rank seniority, searched by partial date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ships/SHIP01/crew?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=rank&sortDirection=asc&search=05 Apr
X-Api-Key: {{crewingKey}}

### Financial report, detail (SHIP02 is on an Apr-Mar fiscal year: YTD Apr 2024 - Feb 2025)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ships/SHIP02/financial-reports/detail?period=2025-02
X-Api-Key: {{crewingKey}}

### Financial report, summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ships/SHIP02/financial-reports/summary?period=2025-02
X-Api-Key: {{crewingKey}}

### Issue an API key for user 3 (Administrator; the key is shown once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/3/api-keys
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expiresInDays": 30 }
